SIMPLE  =                    T / Standard FITS format                           BITPIX  =                    8 / bits per pixel                                 NAXIS   =                    0 / empty array                                    EXTEND  =                    T /                                                END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             XTENSION= 'BINTABLE'           / binary table extension                         BITPIX  =                    8 / array data type                                NAXIS   =                    2 / number of array dimensions                     NAXIS1  =                  272 / length of dimension 1                          NAXIS2  =                20000 / length of dimension 2                          PCOUNT  =                    0 / number of group parameters                     GCOUNT  =                    1 / number of groups                               TFIELDS =                    8 / number of table fields                         TTYPE1  = 'PHOTO'              /                                                TFORM1  =                 '1E' /                                                TTYPE2  = 'RAYLEIGH'           /                                                TFORM2  =                 '1E' /                                                TTYPE3  = 'COMPTON'            /                                                TFORM3  =                 '1E' /                                                